flowchart LR
  H["Pigsty pg-meta host<br/>identity probe only"]
  O["Private PG 17 cluster<br/>C / checksums on"]
  B["Rejected PG 18 target<br/>checksums off"]
  N["Accepted PG 18 target<br/>C / checksums on"]
  G["Release gates<br/>collation, manifest, amcheck"]
  R["Rollback proof<br/>old starts before new writes"]
  F["Forward canary<br/>reconciliation boundary"]

  H -. "no managed-cluster mutation" .-> O
  O -->|"stale collation blocked, repaired"| G
  O -->|"pg_upgrade --check rejected"| B
  O -->|"pg_upgrade --copy"| N
  N --> G
  G --> R
  R --> F
